<title>USA: Yields edge up on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields edge up on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices rose this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday, Oct 10, was 5.73 percent, up three basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.63 percent, up three basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.99 percent, up four basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.73%   5.70%   10/10/96</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.63%   5.60%   10/10/96</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.99%   5.95%   10/10/96</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
